OL,3,AIran faces 'greatest financial
OL,4,Aoffensive ever', says US treasury
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US has announced a host of
OL,8,Fsanctions against Iran and its
OL,9,Fsupporters as part of what Treasury
OL,10,FSecretary Scott Bessent said was "the
OL,11,Fsingle greatest financial offensive
OL,12,Fever".
OL,14,FLabelling it an "economic D-Day" for
OL,15,FIran, Bessent said the US would sever
OL,16,Fall economic ties with the country and
OL,17,Fadded that any nation financially
OL,18,Fpartnering with Iran would also be
OL,19,Fisolated.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
