OL,3,AIran faces 'greatest financial
OL,4,Aoffensive ever', says US treasury
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Our objective is to sever every
OL,8,Feconomic lifeline that sustains this
OL,9,Ftyrannical regime until Tehran stands
OL,10,Falone," he told a press conference.
OL,12,FIran has warned it would shut down all
OL,13,Foil exports from the region if the war
OL,14,Fwith the US and Israel continues.
